@@ -0,0 +1,302 @@
+/*!
+ * \file
+ * mfront/include/MFront/GenericParallelBehaviour/FiniteStrainIntegrators.hxx
+ * \brief  This file declares the integration strategies of finite strain
+ * behaviours for the `generic-parallel` interface.
+ * \date   05/10/2026
